    "forearm muscles": "músculos del antebrazo",
    "Forearm tendons can become sensitive to repeated keyboard, gripping, or lifting load.": "Los tendones del antebrazo pueden volverse sensibles al teclado, agarre o levantamiento de cargas repetidos.",
    "Forearm tightness": "Tensión del antebrazo",
